mission "A Chart Beyond the Trade Winds"
    name "A Chart Beyond the Trade Winds"
    description "Carry the chart to Isla Verde and find the pilot named Tomas Vale. He once mapped the Windward Reach for the Company."
    source "Havana"
    destination "Isla Verde"
    lead "Anne Bonny draws you aside as the council disperses. “A surveyor in Havana has found a chart that should not exist. I would hear what he knows before the Company gets to him. Go when you have finished celebrating; it can wait until you have had a proper meal.”"
    reward 360
    speaker offer "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker visit "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker complete "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    to offer
        has "A Free Caribbean: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `A stranger arrives with a salt-stained chart bearing the mark of a survey ship that vanished beyond the eastern trade winds.`
            `Nell recognises the seal as belonging to the Meridian Company, a chartered concern buying harbours and hiring private warships. The chart points east to the Windward Reach, beyond the nearest familiar ports but still within a manageable passage.`
            `The chart is not a treasure map. It is a survey of deep-water routes, anchorages, and fresh-water springs. Whoever owns it could move a fleet unseen.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The chart is not a treasure map. It is a survey of deep-water routes, anchorages, and fresh-water springs. Whoever owns it could move a fleet unseen.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Nell marks the first new harbour on your chart. “This is beyond the waters Vane usually sailed. Keep your eyes open; the old ports are only the beginning.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A Chart Beyond the Trade Winds. Carry the chart to Isla Verde and find the pilot named Tomas Vale. He once mapped the Windward Reach for the Company."
    on visit
        conversation
            `At Isla Verde, Tomas Vale studies the chart and turns pale. The Company has begun marking islands for seizure, and the survey ship was ordered to chart every safe anchorage.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Tomas agrees to help, but warns that the Meridian Company is already moving into the Windward Reach.`
        log "Completed A Chart Beyond the Trade Winds. Received 360 gold. Tomas agrees to help, but warns that the Meridian Company is already moving into the Windward Reach."
